\u0027s add separate conversation bubbles and\navatars for both participants, align chatbot\nmessages to the left and user messages to the\nright, and use different bubble colours to\ndistinguish them.\n\nAdd a background image to make the chat\ninterface more visually appealing while keeping\nthe conversation layout clear.\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"txt":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":61,"deletions":11}}},{"hash":"a39ad06cb45eadd2dc25be817f88e41842905562","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Bkxss.java: Add assertion after adding a task","messageBody":"The task list should contain every task that is\nsuccessfully added.\n\nLet\u0027s assert that the newly added task is present\nin the task list.\n\nThis helps detect violations of the task-list\ninvariant during development without changing\nnormal program behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"64eda0930aa911e841b6916ea3ee76ab7fb9f8a7","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Bkxss.java: Replace command offsets with constants","messageBody":"Command parsing uses unexplained numeric offsets.\n\nThese magic numbers make it harder to understand\nwhich command each substring operation is\nprocessing.\n\nLet\u0027s replace the offsets with named constants\nthat describe their meaning and keep task number\nconversion consistent.\n\nNamed constants make command parsing easier to\nread and maintain without changing the program\u0027s\nbehavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":19,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"89b4278ab347397235e491efebf3b4dfe409abb1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Bkxss.java: Use streams to find matching tasks","messageBody":"Task search uses an imperative loop to filter\ntasks and number matches.\n\nThe filtering logic and result numbering are\nmixed together, which makes the search operation\nless declarative.\n\nLet\u0027s use a stream to collect matching tasks and\nan IntStream to display them with their result\nnumbers.\n\nThis separates task selection from presentation\nwhile preserving the existing search order and\noutput behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":8,"deletions":9}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-11T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"62d38f814cdf64dd5857d6d22dc16f5f99d88073","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from ys000009/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Bkxss.java: Add assertion after adding a task","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"cb572e3a3a8a1180771cc276966023f0d4abe771","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge master into A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"072e8d589150cb2007e6ec6adc173addedb56fac","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge master into A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"52a2ac5aa79c6e2a07e653ec0e7df38411a8d36f","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from ys000009/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Bkxss.java: Replace command offsets with constants","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"c656cdd8e28d54f854a942e636429ce384e04f78","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge master into A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"dfa781dbb30f44e1fc5536a15145c179a0663d3f","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from ys000009/branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"Bkxss.java: Use streams to find matching tasks","tags":["A-Streams"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"3a5f7bd7727ffeb5773c56ebddd2aef8dc30f681","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Bkxss.java: Extract find command handler","messageBody":"The command handler mixes command routing with\nthe details of task search.\n\nThis makes the method longer and forces readers\nto understand two levels of logic at the same\ntime.\n\nLet\u0027s extract the find command logic into\nhandleFindCommand.\n\nThis keeps command routing focused and makes the\ntask search behavior easier to read and maintain\nwithout changing the program\u0027s output.\n","tags":["More-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":15,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"cf2a823e35f0ca252201b4e53a69bfff63883a3c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add free-time search for scheduled events","messageBody":"Users need a reliable way to find an available period among their\nsaved events. Add a findfree command that returns the earliest slot of a\nrequested whole-hour duration within a given range.\n\nKeep legacy free-text events loadable while preventing ambiguous\nschedule calculations. Document the command and cover its search,\nvalidation, and persistence behavior with automated tests.\n","tags":["BCD-Extension"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":342,"deletions":3},"md":{"insertions":105,"deletions":14}}},{"hash":"2c9a4b8e88e9c7fc2893a249c4213fcae241c12d","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #4 from ys000009/branch-A-AddExtension","messageBody":"Add free-time search for scheduled events","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"ys000009":{"java":1091,"md":551,"fxml":0,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":13,"txt":6}},"authorContributionVariance":{"ys000009":28410.395},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"ys000009":"CS2103T-F13-3 YANG..SHUO"}}
